{"id": "34541", "title": "撒旦的天使新娘", "author": "陈美琳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 29, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34541.htm", "intro": "身为一个神界的见习小天使，她发誓！她一点都不笨，只是……只是迷糊了点，真的！就像这回，她又迷糊地撞倒了雕像；小事嘛，又没砸死人！只是刚巧不巧砸断冥王撒旦头上的角而已……而这霸道又该死的撒旦，竟要挟她到冥界赎罪！！冥界耶！完了！她的天使梦飞了，怕是无缘下人间会一会她的明星偶像了！赎罪就赎罪！可这撒旦王也太难伺候了吧！？冷酷易怒不说，还小心眼地批评她的偶像；更过分的是，他的角长好了，她可以一圆她的天使梦了，他却又不可理喻地烧了她的天使翅膀，存心要她回不了神界！什么嘛！这个可恶的撒旦……就算爱她，也别毁了人家的天使梦啊！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34541", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2191081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191082.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191083.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191085.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191086.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191087.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191088.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191089.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191090.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191091.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191092.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2191104.html", "available": fal